<title>SOUTH KOREA: Sam Yang Foods in 3-for-100 bonus issue.</title>
<headline>Sam Yang Foods in 3-for-100 bonus issue.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Sam Yang Foods Co said on Monday it plans to offer a 3-for-100 bonus issue in April, raising its paid-in capital to 7.21 billion won from the current seven billion.</p>
<p>Sam Yang will issue 42,000 common shares and allocate them to its shareholders registered as of April 25, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>Sam Yang shares traded at 25,100 won in Monday morning, up 200 won on the day.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727-5646</p>
</text>
